# The default suite's programs, one a line, in the order selfbuild's scenario
# runs them in one boot of the test image: those that rewrite the account
# files after those that read them, and those that change staged files last.
# A program that one architecture alone builds has `i686` or `x86_64` after
# its name. Each has a case guest.default.NAME of
# tests/cases/guest.default.json, and tools/verify/probecheck.sh reads this
# file.
